# WHITELIST: only the project skeleton below is tracked. EVERYTHING else under unity/ is ignored on
# purpose - above all the imported ripped PvZ2 assets (Assets/plantrip/**), which are PopCap/EA's and
# must never be pushed. They are regenerated at any time by rip_plant.py + the import step.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/Assets/
/Assets/*
!/Assets/Editor/
!/Assets/Editor.meta
!/ProjectSettings/
!/Packages/
# Unity writes these into the whitelisted folders
/ProjectSettings/*.log
/Packages/*.log
